       fhir:ImplementationGuide.definition.resource.description [ fhir:value "Domain profile for Norwegian Vital Signs Observation Heart Rate information.  \nTo be used for recording the rate and associated attributes for a heart beat. This profile describes how to use a SNOMED code to indicate that the measurement is a general heart rate measurement, and not a more specific measurement of the actual heart beat or pulse reading." ] ;
