       fhir:ImplementationGuide.definition.resource.description [ fhir:value "Domain profile for Norwegian Vital Signs Observation Pulse information. To be used for recording the number of times your arteries create a noticeable pulse due to increase in blood pressure. This profile describes how to use a SNOMED code to indicate that the measurement is actually a pulse measurement at systemic artery, and not a general heart rate measurement that can be measured both as pulse and the actual heart beat." ] ;
